  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain one of the following feature options of your choice. Whenever you finish a Short or Long Rest, you can replace the chosen option with the other one.</p><p><strong>Escape the Horde.</strong> Opportunity Attacks have Disadvantage against you.</p><p><strong>Multiattack Defense.</strong> When a creature hits you with an attack roll, that creature has Disadvantage on all other attack rolls against you this turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-5BXeADNIjwRdwzBf\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes a <strong>Multiattack Defense</strong> activity with an Active Effect which can be used to track a creature that has Disadvantage against you but it does not automate the effect.</p></section>",
